        "text_cpct7n": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A traditional contractor may be the right choice for a multilevel deck, complex house attachment, rooftop deck, integrated outdoor kitchen, unusual structural span or project outside A-DIY’s supported configurations.<br/><br/>A-DIY may be the better choice when you want a standardized design, transparent materials, a known system price, less cutting and measuring at the property and the option to assemble it yourself or hire local help.<br/><br/>A-DIY is not a New York deck contractor, contractor directory or local installation company. A-DIY supplies the deck system.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
